[0.0, "o", "\u001b[1;36m\u276f user\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;37m  Read CLAUDE.md. Final QA session.\r\n  \r\n  1. Run npm run validate, npm run test, npm run build. Fix any failures.\r\n  2. Review App.jsx and components for bugs: NaN handling when grade input is empty or out of range, division by zero,\r\n   filter combinations that contradict (max total cost lower than cheapest tuition), letter-grade edge cases. Fix what\r\n   you find and extend scripts/test-match.mjs with regressions.\r\n  3. Add a README.md: what the app is, screenshot placeholder, how matching works (the formula), how to run, how to de\r\n  ploy to Vercel.\r\n  4. Add vercel.json if needed for a Vite SPA, and a .gitignore.\r\n  5. Leave the repo clean: git init, initial commit with a conventional message.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
